      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استغرد الرَّوْضُ الذُّبَابَ</span></b>  <i>The meadows,</i> or
<i>gardens, by their luxuriance</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَعْمَة</span>, as in the L
